      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        231.86563110351562,
        386.8514099121094,
        246.28663635253906
      ],
      "text": "(13) BCG vaccination: BCG vaccines: WHO position paper, 2018",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        253.48019409179688,
        401.3980712890625,
        267.90118408203125
      ],
      "text": "Bacillus Calmette-Guérin (BCG) vaccination at birth vs at 6 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        275.27069091796875,
        517.7067260742188,
        289.7137145996094
      ],
      "text": "In countries or settings with a high incidence of TB and/or leprosy, a single dose of BCG vaccine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        287.27069091796875,
        498.08160400390625,
        301.7137145996094
      ],
      "text": "should be given to neonates at birth, or as soon as possible thereafter, for prevention of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        299.27069091796875,
        513.12744140625,
        313.7137145996094
      ],
      "text": "and leprosy disease. If it cannot be given at birth, it should be given at the earliest opportunity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        311.27069091796875,
        506.0489196777344,
        325.7137145996094
      ],
      "text": "thereafter and should not be delayed. Any delay in vaccination may lead to opportunities for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        323.27069091796875,
        371.0306701660156,
        337.7137145996094
      ],
      "text": "known or unknown exposure to TB or leprosy-infected contacts.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        339.522705078125,
        513.134033203125,
        353.9657287597656
      ],
      "text": "Co-administration of BCG with the hepatitis B birth dose is safe and strongly recommended. In",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        351.522705078125,
        506.5570983886719,
        365.9657287597656
      ],
      "text": "order to avoid missed opportunities for neonatal vaccination, BCG multi-dose vials should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        363.522705078125,
        342.9599914550781,
        377.9657287597656
      ],
      "text": "opened and used despite any wastage of unused vaccine.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        379.77471923828125,
        504.56842041015625,
        394.2177429199219
      ],
      "text": "If the birth dose was missed, catch-up vaccination of unvaccinated older infants and children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        391.77471923828125,
        512.5355834960938,
        406.2177429199219
      ],
      "text": "is recommended since evidence shows it is beneficial. Catch-up vaccination should be done at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        403.77471923828125,
        509.662353515625,
        418.2177429199219
      ],
      "text": "the earliest convenient encounter with the health care system to minimize known or unknown",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        415.77471923828125,
        278.5081787109375,
        430.2177429199219
      ],
      "text": "exposure to TB or leprosy infected contacts.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        437.21331787109375,
        204.7510528564453,
        451.6343078613281
      ],
      "text": "Selective BCG vaccination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        459.00390625,
        505.8475646972656,
        473.4469299316406
      ],
      "text": "Countries with a low incidence of TB or leprosy may choose to selectively vaccinate neonates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        471.00390625,
        503.7642822265625,
        485.4469299316406
      ],
      "text": "in recognized risk groups for developing disease. High-risk groups to be considered for BCG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        483.00390625,
        233.10032653808594,
        497.4469299316406
      ],
      "text": "vaccination include the following:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        499.25592041015625,
        462.04290771484375,
        513.6989135742188
      ],
      "text": "•\tNeonates to parents (or other close contacts/relatives) with previous TB or leprosy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        515.5078125,
        502.95416259765625,
        529.9508056640625
      ],
      "text": "•\tNeonates in households with contacts to countries with high incidence of TB and/or leprosy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        531.759765625,
        412.0963134765625,
        546.2027587890625
      ],
      "text": "•\tNeonates in any other locally identified risk group for TB and/or leprosy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        552.263671875,
        514.7069702148438,
        566.7066650390625
      ],
      "text": "In a few countries with low TB incidence, BCG vaccination is largely replaced by intensified case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        564.263671875,
        342.73406982421875,
        578.7066650390625
      ],
      "text": "detection, contact tracing and supervised early treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        585.7024536132812,
        190.15740966796875,
        600.1234130859375
      ],
      "text": "Need for revaccination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        607.4930419921875,
        487.2752380371094,
        621.93603515625
      ],
      "text": "Studies show minimal or no evidence of any additional benefit of repeat BCG vaccination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        619.4930419921875,
        513.140625,
        633.93603515625
      ],
      "text": "against TB or leprosy. Therefore, revaccination is not recommended even if the TST reaction or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        631.4930419921875,
        509.87139892578125,
        645.93603515625
      ],
      "text": "result of an IGRA is negative. The absence of a BCG scar after vaccination is not indicative of a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        643.4930419921875,
        349.24688720703125,
        657.93603515625
      ],
      "text": "lack of protection and is not an indication for revaccination.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "12 WHO consolidated",
